# Files excluded from the tarball uploaded to EAS Build.
#
# IMPORTANT: when this file exists, EAS CLI uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore — not
# in addition to it. So every exclude that matters has to be repeated here.

# Dependencies / caches (would otherwise be uploaded, since .gitignore is bypassed)
node_modules/
.expo/
.git/

# Secrets — mirrors .gitignore. Never ship these to a build worker.
google-play-service-account.json
*-service-account.json
*.p8

# Local build artifacts
*.ipa
*.aab

# Pre-built JS export output (~95 MB of .hbc + source maps). EAS Build runs its
# own bundler, so these are dead weight in the upload: they took the tarball to
# 127 MB and the upload died mid-flight with EPIPE. Excluding them is safe —
# the committed copies stay in git for whatever consumes them.
dist/
